==Description==
The '''DeepSea Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 32 of the premium [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{BeachBalls|1,110}} or {{Robux|75}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|16,600}} or {{Robux|2,681}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|94}} with a total cost of {{Robux|3,368}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a total cost of {{Robux|2,616}}.

The '''DeepSea Nametag''' has blue text with a dark blue outline. Blue smoke appears behind the text. A blue aura also appears around the player.

